  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Hi, Andrew Day.",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 0.24,
      "end_time": 1.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks for joining.",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 1.12,
      "end_time": 2.04
    },
    {
      "text": "How are you doing today?",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 2.04,
      "end_time": 2.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I'm good, thank you.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 5.76,
      "end_time": 6.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Great to hear.",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 8.32,
      "end_time": 9.04
    },
    {
      "text": "So I'll be walking you through some questions today to learn more about your business.",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 9.12,
      "end_time": 12.48
    },
    {
      "text": "This should be a pretty straightforward conversation.",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 12.72,
      "end_time": 14.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Just want to get a good understanding of what you've built.",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 15.12,
      "end_time": 17.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Ready to dive in?",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 17.52,
      "end_time": 18.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, sure.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 19.6,
      "end_time": 20.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Awesome.",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 26.01,
      "end_time": 26.41
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's start from the beginning.",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 26.41,
      "end_time": 27.61
    },
    {
      "text": "Can you tell me how the business started and what's the story behind it?",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 27.69,
      "end_time": 30.89
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 33.05,
      "end_time": 33.53
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm listening.",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 35.69,
      "end_time": 36.45
    },
    {
      "text": "Go ahead and tell me about how the business got started and the story behind it.",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 36.45,
      "end_time": 39.93
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, we got started in.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 40.89,
      "end_time": 42.33
    },
    {
      "text": "We got started nine years ago.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 42.73,
      "end_time": 45.77
    },
    {
      "text": "And it started because I sold my old company.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 46.49,
      "end_time": 49.17
    },
    {
      "text": "And I want to say something after that.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 49.17,
      "end_time": 52.54
    },
    {
      "text": "And so I fell into M and A because I got asked by a friend for me to help them buy a company like the one I just sold for.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 52.54,
      "end_time": 61.62
    },
    {
      "text": "That's a great origin story.",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 64.74,
      "end_time": 66.18
    },
    {
      "text": "So you had that firsthand M and A experience and it led you into the business?",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 66.42,
      "end_time": 69.7
    },
    {
      "text": "Love it.",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 69.94,
      "end_time": 70.5
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, who's involved in the business today?",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 70.58,
      "end_time": 72.18
    },
    {
      "text": "Can you tell me about the directors and any key staff members?",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 72.42,
      "end_time": 75.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, it's just.",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 76.75,
      "end_time": 77.35
    },
    {
      "text": "It's just.",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 77.35,
      "end_time": 77.87
    },
    {
      "text": "Got.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 82.67,
      "end_time": 82.95
    },
    {
      "text": "It.",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 82.95,
      "end_time": 83.19
    },
    {
      "text": "So you're running the show solo.",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 83.19,
      "end_time": 84.67
    },
    {
      "text": "That's pretty lean.",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 84.83,
      "end_time": 85.71
    },
    {
      "text": "What about the shareholding structure?",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 85.79,
      "end_time": 87.39
    },
    {
      "text": "How is that set up?",
      "speaker_name": "Agent",
      "start_time": 87.39,
      "end_time": 88.59
    },
    {
      "text": "80% to me, 20% to an investor you missed.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 89.87,
      "end_time": 93.63
    },
    {
      "text": "The five works for me.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 93.63,
      "end_time": 95.39
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm not sure I understand what you mean by 5.",
